<tr>
<td class="white"><span class="color3">使用ツール：２０００</span></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="white"><span class="color3">作者：ＫＳＤ</span></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="red"><span class="color2">ジャンル：パクり</span></td>
